 "note": "The box's swap arm, v8, for latch v7 and both packs. Two heads 180 apart; each is a lift on a bought MGN12H rail driven by a T8 x 2 screw, with three carbon rods out under the grab unit, picking its carriage up for the last 54.1 mm: 115.80000000000001 mm to the drone seat. Push limited by the grab unit's float springs to 118 N (x1.83 over the Overseer insert); the screw holds with the power off. Bays at R 129. Swap cycle, both packs, 551 states: 0 overlaps. Shown as their setups (drawn attachments and envelope), their runs pending: hub, carriage, lift.",
